@startuml
start
:Input signed target T\n(+ charge / - discharge);
:Read fresh primary-storage signed power Pp\n(+ charge / - discharge);
if (Cross-Charge enabled\nand T != 0\nand primary data valid?) then (no)
  :Return T unchanged;
  stop
endif
if (T and Pp opposite directions?) then (no)
  :Release latch according to hysteresis;
  :Return T unchanged;
  stop
endif
:Engage/keep latch if threshold met;
:Corrected = T + round(Pp);
:Clamp correction so target can only\nmove toward 0, never reverse direction;
if (Correction active after Fast B+O?) then (yes)
  :Force Fast overlay O=0;
  :Re-evaluate Cross-Charge against baseline B only;
endif
:Publish corrected signed target;
stop
@enduml
